# Best Practices

* Investigate only publicly accessible resources.
* Never bypass authentication mechanisms.
* Respect privacy and legal boundaries.
* Avoid downloading unnecessary files.
* Follow responsible disclosure if accidental exposure is identified.
* Always verify findings before reporting them.

